## UUID BLE used by project

| Caractéristique | UUID                                   |
|-----------------|----------------------------------------|
| Service         | `f3b6e2a0-8c4e-4e1f-9c2d-1a7f5b9a1c01` |
| ambiant         | `f3b6e2a0-8c4e-4e1f-9c2d-1a7f5b9a1c05` |
| audio           | `f3b6e2a0-8c4e-4e1f-9c2d-1a7f5b9a1c04` |

The **service** UUID is used only for advertising. data exchange is done using the **data** UUID. At the moment data only accept READ to query for value. the payload is returned and must be unpacked.
